<title>MALI: U.S., Mali and Senegal wrap up military manoeuvres.</title>
<headline>U.S., Mali and Senegal wrap up military manoeuvres.</headline>
<dateline>BAMAKO 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States, Mali and Senegal on Tuesday wrapped up two months of military manoeuvres dubbed Flintlock Two and focusing on peacekeeping in conflict zones.</p>
<p>Mali's armed forces chief of staff, Colonel Siriman Keita, told reporters the exercises in the Segou region were &quot;an important step towards creating an African intervention force to maintain peace&quot;.</p>
</text>
